{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_02_end","storyGroup":"act40side","storySort":5,"storyDependence":"act40side_level_act40side_02_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OR-2","storyName":"糖瓜粘","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"煌与行箸在百灶寻找煌记忆里的桔红酥，两人找遍了百灶的大街小巷依然一无所获。最终小大厨提出，鼎丰楼的主厨莫不服是全百灶最德高望重的厨师，他或许知道那种桔红酥的做法。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act40side/level_act40side_02_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act40side_02","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":3,"next":5,"characters":["行箸","煌","麟青砚","凛然的女性","“禁军小教头”","小大厨"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"煌小姐，这个味道怎么样？","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"唔......嗯......还不错。","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"我是说......这家的桔红酥，是你印象里的那种味道吗？","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"好像......还是不太一样。","id":19},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"还是没有我吃过的甜，口感也有些区别......","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"奇怪，这家一心坊的点心，做法应该是最传统的，近一百年都没有变过才对。","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"可是——啊，一百年？这道点心有那么久的历史吗？","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"没有那么久，但在百灶，这样能叫得上名字的点心，或多或少都能追溯到一些历史的。","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"煌小姐在找的这种桔红酥，其实就是早年间，一位进京求学的书生发明的。","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"那书生的故乡盛产柑桔，他在百灶的时候，怀念故乡物产，但路途遥远，不能轻易吃到，于是他便发明了一种点心的做法。","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"将陈年桔皮碾碎，和进做月饼的酥皮里，只加少量佐料，简单烘烤。这种做法成本极低，而且做出来的点心真的有一股柑桔的香味。","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"书生把这种配方卖给住宿的旅店换取生活费，还为这点心写了句诗，“遥知桔林染，乡心一点红”。所以，这种点心就叫桔红酥了。","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"后来这位书生考校高中，这道桔红酥便被众人所知，在流传的过程中，也被赋予了“思乡”或“思念”的含义。","id":32},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"象征思念......","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"食物象征一种情感......这还从来没有听说过，唔......有意思。","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"嗯，炎国幅员辽阔，不同地区的气候、物产天差地别，也因此诞生了不同的菜系。这一道道菜品，说是炎国民生的历史书也不为过。","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"像以炎国四大菜系为特色，大名鼎鼎的“四大名楼”，在百灶还不是移动城市的时候就有啦。","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"城市发展日新月异，但是一些味道却总能留下来，所以一道流行过的点心在历史里完全找不到踪迹，那才是怪事呢。","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"听同事说过，炎国天师分类很多，你懂得这么多，你该不会是什么“美食天师”吧？","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"噗......要是真的有人的源石技艺可以“点石成菜”，那说不定还挺值得研究的。","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"不过我只是一个爱好者罢了，平时习惯将美食相关的所见所闻都用笔记下来。时间长了，记得的也就多了。","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"话说回来，煌小姐，如果像你说的，真有能让点心变得更好吃的一种配方，那它不该不为人知呀。","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"可我总记得，小时候吃到的桔红酥，就是要更甜更香一点。","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"这就有点奇怪了......","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"传统桔红酥的做法，讲究不见桔子的果肉但能吃出桔子的香气，所以对糖的用量非常克制，是种口味比较清淡的点心。","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"可煌小姐说的桔红酥加了很多糖......我也没有听说过有哪家的桔红酥做了这种改动。","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"或许我们可以委托一位点心师傅，让他试试多放糖呢？","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"可是这样也没法证明我吃过的那种桔红酥曾经确实存在过吧。","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我还是很想知道，这种点心从百灶到维多利亚，怎么就变了味......背后一定有故事。","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"看来煌小姐的爱好，和我是一样的呢。","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"我还担心，带着你走了这么多地方，你会不耐烦呢。","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"本来就是拜托你带我在百灶旅游的，你怎么还和我客气上了？","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"嗯，我们再多去找找吧！","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"不过时间也不早了，我们先去吃午饭吧。","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"嗯？午饭？","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"到了饭点，可不就该吃午饭吗？","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"可是我们刚刚才去过五家点心店啊？！","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"那怎么能一样，点心是点心，不能当正餐的呀！","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我的肚子，已经满了......","id":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"呵呵......我知道一家小店，保证不会让你的肚子遭罪的。","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"煌小姐愿意赏光吗？","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你都这么说了，那我当然就“舍肚子陪君子”啦！","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"......嗯？","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"怎么了？","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"总觉得......有人在跟着我们。","id":86},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":88},{"type":"charslot","id":89},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.15","block":"false","id":90},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.15","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#15$1","posfrom":"-800,0","posto":"-800,0","id":92},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-800,0","posto":"-380,0","duration":"2","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"2.3","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#8$1","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"jump","posto":"0,0","power":"50","times":"1","duration":"0.4","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"0.6","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-380,0","posto":"-900,0","duration":"0.7","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":100},{"type":"dialog","id":101},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":102},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":103},{"type":"charslot","id":104},{"type":"curtain","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":107},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$plot_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_plot_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":110,"musicid":1},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你是......禁军？","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#1$1","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛然的女性","text":"不要误会，不着玄铁甲，我还不属于正式禁军。只论官职，我是隶属于御林卫的校将。","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛然的女性","text":"麟少卿应该也不会想去做那个在光天化日之下见到玄铁甲的人。","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#3$1","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......我听太合提起过，禁军学徒中有一位翘楚，年纪轻轻，实力已远超同僚。","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你就是那位小教头......","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#4$1","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"哼，不过是比武输给过我几次，他也不用这么惦记着，倒显得小气。","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#2$1","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"闲话先放放......我想问问，麟少卿为何在此处？","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......查案。","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#1$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"查的案子是与退休的礼部尚书有关？大理寺批搜查令了吗？","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#13$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"小教头的职责，应该不是监督大理寺如何办案？","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#1$1","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"我的职责，你还没有权限过问。回答我的问题就好。","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......自然。","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#1$1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"听说麟少卿之前出公差，离开过百灶好一阵子？","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"的确，为查一桩旧案找寻证人，补全档案。","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#1$1","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"何时的旧案？什么样的证人，为何现在才去寻找？","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#3$1","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"小教头一连串问题，倒是让我听不明白了。","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"御林卫要是想要调查大理寺的工作，我这便回去整理文档，即刻上交。","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"要是你还不放心，我也可以请大理寺卿大人亲自来解答御林卫的问题。","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#1$1","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"我的问题与大理寺无关，只关乎麟少卿一人。","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"麟少卿追查这桩旧案，查到什么了吗？","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#4$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......时间太久，线索又模糊，最终一无所获。","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#1$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"当真一无所获？","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#1$1","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"的确一无所获。","id":156},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#2$1","id":158},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_scabbard","id":159},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"好，我相信麟少卿。不过也请麟少卿想明白，对御林卫的问题给出的答案，意味着什么。","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"......公事的话，就说到这。","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#13$1","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"小教头的意思是，还有私事要聊？","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#4$1","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"......","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#2$1","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"太合那个笨牛说过，他在官场上的朋友并不多，你可以算一个。","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"所以想奉劝你......莫立危墙之下。","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#2$1","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"小教头应该是多虑了。大理寺的少卿在的地方，应当只有疑案和真相，没有什么危墙。","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1615_1#2$1","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"......好。","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“禁军小教头”","text":"见到太合，替我问好。","id":174},{"type":"dialog","id":175},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":176},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":178},{"type":"charslot","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1612_1#3$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"说我不该在这里，禁军学徒，御林卫的人又为何在这里......","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......这不正说明，我找对方向了吗。","id":182},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":183},{"type":"dialog","id":184},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":185},{"type":"charslot","id":186},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":187},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":188},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":189},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":190},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":191,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":194},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pickupchopsticks","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"呼——","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"满足满足，我还真没想过，路边摊的一碗馄饨能做得这么好吃，和罗德岛食堂冰柜里的速冻馄饨完全不一样！","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"胃里暖和，浑身都暖洋洋的。真想就地睡一觉，啊——唔......","id":200},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"吃了那么多点心，用一碗清汤馄饨换个口味解解腻再合适不过啦。","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"那些远近闻名的大酒楼自然不用我多介绍，煌小姐难得来一次百灶，我当然要带你品尝一下我的私人珍藏。","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我运气还真好，能遇到这么懂行的导游，多谢你啦！","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"其实......我也难得找到一个可以一起吃饭的人。平时自己一个人吃饭，从来不敢多点菜呢。","id":207},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"那现在正好啦，我们一块吃的时候，你想吃几道就点几道，不怕吃不完。","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"说起来，这馄饨里包的是什么？味道这么神奇！","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"这馄饨的馅，就是简单的兽肉和芹菜，但这馄饨的妙处，其实是在汤里。","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"一般馄饨汤的做法，是使用壳兽籽来提鲜。这样做固然可以，但壳兽的荤腥味，多少会挤占别的食材的味道。","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"这里的做法，却是用黄豆芽来吊汤。新鲜的豆芽，自带一丝鲜味，味道不算突出，放在馄饨的清汤里却是正好。","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"包馄饨用的肉馅用肥瘦三七分的新鲜五花肉，馄饨煮熟后，点点油花自然就渗进了汤里。","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"这样做出来的馄饨，口味清淡，味道极鲜。只是对每样食材本身品质的要求很高，别处可是轻易吃不到的。","id":216},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"那这碗馄饨，是不是也有什么来历？跟我讲讲呗。","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"其实也没什么，这只是我常常会来的一家小店。","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"写作不顺、心情不好、没有胃口的时候，我都会来这里吃一碗馄饨。","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"这儿的店主婆婆做了一辈子馄饨。这家小店，原本是由夫妻二人共同经营的。","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"后来婆婆的丈夫病逝了，婆婆便一个人照顾孩子。之后那个孩子投身军伍，几年前牺牲在了北边的一场天灾里。","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"如今婆婆一个人还在坚持开这家小店，她说，想要留住属于他们一家人的味道。","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"......还真是，挺遗憾的。","id":228},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"悲欢离合，人生多的是遗憾，香椿和秋芹，毕竟不可兼得。","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"我来这里的次数多了，偶尔也会帮婆婆一点忙，后来婆婆把她的秘方告诉我，还叮嘱我说，要在她去世以后，替她把这份手艺传下去。","id":231},{"type":"dialog","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":233},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"其实，我有件事想问问煌小姐。","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"煌小姐这样费力地找那种桔红酥，真的只是因为和那位小大厨打了一个赌吗？","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"为啥突然问起这个？","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"我刚刚注意到，煌小姐似乎并没有很在意点心的口味，倒像是有什么别的心事的样子......","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"欸？这你都看出来了？有那么明显吗......","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"一个人在吃饭的时候，心事可是藏不住的。","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"抱歉，只是有些好奇，如果涉及隐秘，煌小姐不便告知——","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"倒也没什么......这一路下来，感觉没必要对你遮掩。","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你说得对，我确实没那么在乎那个赌。","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"其实那种桔红酥，是......我爸在百灶的时候，常常寄给我的点心。","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"煌小姐的父亲，是炎国人？","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"嗯......算了，也没什么好隐瞒的。","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我是在维多利亚长大的，我爸却是大炎人。有一年，他好像因为什么事，又回到了炎国。","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"结果这一去十几年，直到他死在异国他乡，我都没有再见过他。","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"抱歉，煌小姐......","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"嗐，又不是你的错，怎么反而道歉个没完了？","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我本来也没觉得这是多么特殊的事，可是昨天听说那种味道的桔红酥很特殊，我就想，或许会做那个点心的人，认识我爸呢？","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"煌小姐的父亲也是......","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"也是？","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"没......没什么。","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"我明白了，既然有这层缘由，煌小姐，在下一定竭尽全力帮你找到相关的线索——","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你这人好奇怪，吃饭的时候豪爽，讲话的时候像大家闺秀。","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"明明是一起大吃大喝的朋友，怎么一放下筷子就变得这么客气了？","id":274},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"......","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"朋友吗......","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"对了，那你呢？你又为什么要陪我找点心？","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"其实，我想写一部书。","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"如今能见到的美食书，大都只记载名家名厨的菜谱，可是市井民间明明也藏着许多独一无二的美食，却少有人问津。","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"我想把这些味道都记录下来，或许多年以后，人们看到这本书，也能窥见百灶风貌的一角......只是一个自负的妄想。","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"还有......","id":285},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"还有？","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"还是先保密吧。","id":289},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":291},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":292},{"type":"dialog","id":293},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"charslot","id":295},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":296},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":297},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":300},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"对了对了，反正都出来玩了，不如你带我去几个地方呗？","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"好啊，你想去哪里？","id":305},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.6","id":306},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"让我看看......信上写的，明德书局、守拙园，还有百灶学宫......","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"嘶......这个字是什么意思来着？","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"可以让我看看吗？","id":311},{"type":"dialog","id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"all","id":313},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","id":314},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"这是信？哎呀，怎么还沾了这么多油？","id":317},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这可不是我弄的！信寄过来的时候就已经是这样了。我也不知道我爸当时是怎么搞的......","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"这些信，都是你父亲寄给你的？","id":321},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"对啊，家里还完好保存着的，就这几封了。","id":323},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"（奇怪，这信纸不是......）","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"嗯？怎么了？","id":327},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"没，没什么......只是这信上写的这些地点大多已经消失不见了。","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"不见了？这不过才十几年吧？","id":331},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"十几年，对百灶来说，也够城市变几番样貌了。","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"来到百灶后，你有没有发现什么不同？","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"除了吃的东西......就是这随处可见的能源桩了......要消耗这么多能源，有点太奢侈了......","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"这不是奢侈，更像是“不得已而为之”。","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"百灶建城之初，要追溯到很久远的时候......","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"那时的炎国刚经历过一场大战，国家百废待兴，但就在一片战场的废墟旁，人们发现了一条极为富饶的源石矿脉。","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这么巧？你们炎国人运气也太好了吧。","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"不，一点也不好。那条源石矿脉固然富饶，可就是因为太富饶了，极易吸引源石微粒继续在此富集，引发天灾。","id":344},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"总之，它不仅难以开采，还会让方圆百公里的土地都变成天灾频发的地区。对此，当时的人们束手无策。","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"直到有一位天师提议，既然富饶的矿脉会造成天灾，那直接把城市建在矿脉上，让高能耗的设施去消耗它不就好了？","id":347},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"把城市造在源石矿上？这不是找死吗？！","id":349},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"的确是一个非常冒险的做法，不过当时的真龙采纳了这一谏言，炎国也的确这么做了。后来，就有了百灶这座城市。","id":351},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":352},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"没办法想象......那时候的人们到底是怎么做到的。","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"其实我也不是很清楚，关于那一段历史，史书上只有一句话——","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"“......遣能人异士先赴灾域，历五十三载，城成，定都。取照拂天下烟火之意，赐名百灶。”","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"至于更详细的技术，恐怕就只有在天师府的高级教材上才能看到了，不过那就不是我了解的领域啦。","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"所以时至今日，百灶依然鼓励将这些能源善加利用的行为......","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"这座百灶城，几乎是一刻不停地发生着改变，你看到的这些高楼大厦，还有望不到头的移动地块，都是这样来的。","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"......","id":363},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"这些参与建造城市的人，后来怎么样了......？","id":365},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"......","id":367},{"type":"dialog","id":368},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":369},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":370},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":371},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":372},{"type":"charslot","id":373},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":374},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_bg_25_g03_yandowntown_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":375},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":376},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":377},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":378,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","duration":"0.5","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":380},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"唉......","id":383},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"肚子是塞满了，可是该找的味道还是没有找到啊......","id":385},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"我知道的点心铺子的确已经吃遍了......","id":387},{"type":"multiline","name":"行箸","text":"或许，明天我们再去一些酒楼里找找，说不定还有一些点心师傅藏在......","id":388},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":389},{"type":"multiline","name":"行箸","text":"嗝——","id":390},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"......","id":392},{"type":"dialog","id":393},{"type":"charslot","id":394},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":395},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":396},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"我说什么来着，我说什么来着？","id":398},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"找了一整天，可找到你说的正宗桔红酥了？","id":399},{"type":"charslot","id":400},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"你一直在跟着我们？","id":403},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你是怕我们真的找到手艺比你好的厨师吧。","id":405},{"type":"charslot","id":406},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#15$1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"我怕？怎么可能！","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"早就告诉过你们，全百灶手艺最好的厨师就在你们眼前。我不会做的菜，别人更不会做；我这都吃不到的味道，别处更吃不到。","id":409},{"type":"charslot","id":410},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":411},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"煌小姐，我吃过这位小大厨做的菜。他的手艺的确是精妙，非一般人能及。","id":413},{"type":"charslot","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#17$1","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"......！","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#18$1","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"你......你倒是会说话......","id":418},{"type":"charslot","id":419},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":420},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":421},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"而且，你们争论的只是一道点心有做法上的差异，又怎会成为评判一位厨师厨艺高下的标准呢？","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"不过先生，其实你也很好奇，煌小姐说的那种桔红酥的配方，对吧？","id":423},{"type":"charslot","id":424},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#4$1","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"......也没有多想知道。","id":426},{"type":"charslot","id":427},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":428},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"不如这样，你们的赌局先作罢，我们商议一下，还有哪里可能找得到那种味道的桔红酥。","id":430},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"煌小姐找到了想找的点心，先生也多知晓了一种配方，这不是两全其美的事吗？","id":431},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我......你......啊？","id":433},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"那我的一个月饭票怎么算——","id":435},{"type":"dialog","id":436},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-50,0","duration":"0.5","id":437},{"type":"delay","time":"0.51","id":438},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.5","id":439},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-50,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","id":440},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0.5","id":441},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":442},{"type":"charslot","id":443},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#15$1","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"哼，虽说我的厨艺已经是出神入化无人能及，但除我之外，也不全是泛泛之辈。要说有那么一手绝活，能让我高看一眼的，也就......","id":445},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#4$1","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"一定要说的话......也就是......","id":447},{"type":"charslot","id":448},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":449},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"也就是......？","id":451},{"type":"charslot","id":452},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#2$1","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"百灶四大名楼，排名头一号的鼎丰楼，他们的总厨。","id":454},{"type":"charslot","id":455},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":456},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"您是说，莫不服，莫先生？","id":458},{"type":"charslot","id":459},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#2$1","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"鼎丰楼最近忙着承办今年的百珍宴，老头子应该也就参与最后一届了吧。","id":461},{"type":"charslot","id":462},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":463},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"最后一届？他这是打算要退休了？","id":465},{"type":"charslot","id":466},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#15$1","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"谁知道呢！这老头子最近四处下战书，真显得他威风了......","id":468},{"type":"charslot","id":469},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":470},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":471},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"那还等什么！我们这就去找他呀！","id":472},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":473},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"没那么简单......","id":474},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"莫大厨身份非比寻常，尤其最近还要负责国宴，只是为一道点心去找他，根本是不可能的事......","id":475},{"type":"charslot","id":476},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"姑娘倒是机灵，不过话只说对了一半。如果你们真的想去见他，我倒是有一个办法。","id":478},{"type":"dialog","id":479},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","id":480},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":481},{"type":"charslot","id":482},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":483},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"上个月的发票？","id":485},{"type":"charslot","id":486},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#8$1","id":487},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"不对，不是这个口袋里的......","id":488},{"type":"dialog","id":489},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","id":490},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":491},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"这回没错了，看。","id":493},{"type":"charslot","id":494},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":495},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":496},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"鼎丰楼厨师选拔赛的请帖......","id":497},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":498},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行箸","text":"煌小姐，眼下想见到莫大厨，这确实是个不多得的机会。","id":499},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"那还等什么，你们谁去参赛，带我一个！","id":501},{"type":"charslot","id":502},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_2026_yu_1#1$1","id":503},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小大厨","text":"至于参赛人选嘛......","id":504},{"type":"dialog","id":505},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","id":506},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":507},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","id":508},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"等等，你看我做什么？！","id":509},{"type":"dialog","id":510},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":511},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":512},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":513},{"type":"image","id":514},{"type":"charslot","id":515}],"characters":["行箸","煌","麟青砚","凛然的女性","“禁军小教头”","小大厨"]}